| 1 | `[ID]` | `[Verify progress is saved when video finishes – V1]` | User type: `[Active user, Type A]`; run setup query from Section 4 | 1. Log in <br> 2. Open `[page]` <br> 3. Play video to the end | UI marks item complete; progress record created (Section 4) | `[Name] / [Date] / Pass` | `[Name] / [Date] / Pass` | Pending / In progress / Done / N/A | |
| 2 | `[ID]` | `[Verify error modal when nothing is selected]` | … | … | Error modal shown (Section 3); no record created | | | | |
| 3 | `[ID]` | `[Verify decision table row 4: capacity reached]` | … | … | Item opened WITHOUT special tag | | | | |

